12930873901", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618484_649512934207234_7095113286224355206_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KOB1uVno-V8Q7kNvwHO7Htw&_nc_oc=AdkVdUzstT0HpuY5xjEV91bPUrmx5nHAJHQmybNFIe30atJbr6u_fvPkaP-910AhxSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsMRJRNCU-ZDV0G_8u7E_n2WNodIQ8qlfb37DKFeU5z3g&oe=69A428E4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1467992020894328", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619742_1467992024227661_8934197663888657607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P75fOb9lqh4Q7kNvwH2MRIL&_nc_oc=Adl5NMOnX7oso6qxPACQbwh-gRpY_8izvTgCOVw2jdN2ey5J19Upee1pSxrPamiZctQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afse5qlaLpj4_CqJc2HTypgOXx9MlyhaRL4Li9IEzqxIOA&oe=69A43E40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bending Champions", "keywords": ["avatar", "element", "fight", "free", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Choose an element, battle others, become a bending champion.\nIn Bending Champions you must strike martial art poses to bend the elements. A magic system that is both rewarding and difficult to master. Fight other players to earn currency to spend on unlocking cosmetics and customizing your avatar.\n\n# Fight others\n- **1v1 duels** for pure skill\n- **2v2 and 3v3 team fights** for the power of friendship\n- **1v1v1v1** for an all out brawl\n# Choose your playstyle\n- **Earth:** Defensive and slower, but hard hitting\n- **Water:** Rapid fire and buildup\n- **Fire:** High damage and targeting\n- **Air:** Low damage but high mobility and knockback", "short_description": "A VR multiplayer arena fighter where you master elemental bending through martial art poses. Choose your element, battle others, and become a bending champion."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://desmondlorenzini.github.io/TwoLifeGames/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Desmon